  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（后）\nHow many men have fallen before you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "(Speaking Ursine).",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Of course. I will bring it back for you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "...... (Speaking Ursine)......?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "No. I'm not going to Chernobog.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Rest.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "You'll be safe here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Get some rest.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "How many men have fallen before me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Drop your weapon!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Just you...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Move and I shoot!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Shoot first. Then ask questions.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "What? He... disappeared?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "No... I saw your file. You're Faust, one of their leaders. Your Arts won't fool me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "I know this is just an optical trick. If I shoot, you'll still have a bolt in your head.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Wrong.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "——!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Can you predict my movements?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "The two of us, lone crossbowmen. If we both pull the trigger at the same time, we both die.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "What's your name?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Codename GreyThroat. When did you get behind me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "The third time you blinked.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "You're pretty direct...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "You've been separated from your squad. I'm not here to kill people who don't want a fight.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "We're enemies.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Rhodes Island is here to save the Infected. I saw you helping them.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Those were my comrades. You're my enemy.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "When did Rhodes Island hire someone so naive?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Yes, I'm naive. All I can do is follow orders. I freeze up whenever I have to make a decision for myself.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "You need to be careful.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Watch your finger!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "That's a single shot crossbow. If I dodge your bolt, you're dead. Don't pull that trigger.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "If you only follow orders, if you rely on everyone else to tell you what to do, that can only end poorly.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Why?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Most of the sheep who blindly take orders aren't actually dependent on anyone. They just haven't started thinking for themselves...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "And those who have no direction in life, they're just empty machines looking for a sense of accomplishment, and meaning.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "You activate, and perform your function, you input a goal, you achieve your goal, until you consume everything around you, and you consume those you serve.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "I won't.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "You're inexperienced.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "I saw your interaction with the Infected back there. You're doing the right thing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Your opinion means nothing to me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Faust, you've been avoiding the L. G. D. Even the ones who are out here on their own, you haven't shot at them. I've been watching you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Don't take my patience for weakness. If I ambushed you, you'd be dead.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "But you didn't.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "You're exhausted. Take it from a crossbowman, your string is drawn too tight. It's definitely going to snap.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Take it from a crossbowman, you're too much.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "You've also seen those... special Infected. We can figure this one out together.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Maybe you're right.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Wait!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "But there's nothing I can do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "(He disappeared the instant he moved...? I can't figure his position!)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "......hm?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Why haven't you killed me?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "You didn't shoot. Neither will I.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "But next time? If you don't kill me, I will kill you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "I don't want to hurt you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "That's too bad.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "I guess you need someone to answer you. Without an answer, you can't understand.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Don't worry about it. Killing, dying, these are everyday facts of life. Even for Rhodes Island.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
      "text": "Why can't we work together to save them?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "I really wish I could. But I know I can't.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "Don't follow me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "You still don't know them. You don't yet have the whole picture.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Faust",
      "text": "...and me? There's nothing I can do anymore.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "How many men have fallen because of things I did? How many men have fallen because of things I didn't do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
